          "exact_quote": "all Curiosity subscale items and one Decentering item",
          "location_hint": "ASMR PCA results, lines 204-205 (p. 9)"
        },
        {
          "input_field": "manuscript_text",
          "exact_quote": "The instructions to this questionnaire were slightly modified to be suitable for individuals with ASMR experiences.",
          "location_hint": "TMS description, lines 137-138 (p. 6)"
        },
        {
          "input_field": "page_images",
          "page": 12,
          "observation": "Lines 224-226 say all Curiosity items loaded onto the primary factor 'for both the ASMR and control participants'. Lines 219-220 on the same page state that two Decentering items also loaded onto the control group's first factor with the Curiosity items. The retained subscale is therefore not clean in either group."
