    {
      "claim": "Several correlations are described as meaningful, including a marginal MTotal-MAAS association and a 'primarily due to' decomposition, without correction for the many tests run and without acknowledging overlap between MTotal and its component factors.",
      "issue_type": "V3",
      "status": "missing_information",
